\subsection{Benign Distribution Shift}
\label{sec:benign_shift}

All preceding OOD results use IID benign data; attack-side generalization does not imply deployment readiness. On WildChat benign conversations, 9-class FPR rises to 68.1\% (Appendix~\ref{app:wildchat_fpr}). Cross-LLM error decomposition confirms that false positives on unfamiliar benign text, not missed attacks, drive the performance collapse (Appendix~\ref{app:cross_llm}).

